tainer></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"203\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mstyle style=\"border: solid 1pt gainsboro;\"><mjx-mpadded><mjx-block style=\"width: 2.578em; margin: 0.4em 0px; position: relative;\"><mjx-rbox style=\"left: 0.4em; top: 0px; max-width: 2.578em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c36\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-rbox></mjx-block></mjx-mpadded></mjx-mstyle></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mstyle style=\"border: solid 1pt gainsboro\"><mpadded height=\"+4pt\" depth=\"+4pt\" lspace=\"4pt\" width=\"+8pt\"><mn>0.61</mn></mpadded></mstyle></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n\n<p>Let's add the solutions to the phase space.</p>\n<div id=\"graphic-5337b20b50e548b2025f92a51c5c24ed\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/5337b20b50e548b2025f92a51c5c24ed\"></div>\n\n<p>The phase portrait of our system looks as follows:</p>\n<div id=\"graphic-0209b4e45b75385aebf345e44c7098a6\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/0209b4e45b75385aebf345e44c7098a6\"></div></div></div>",
